---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

export const prerender = true;
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact - 未名诗阁" description="Contact page." canonicalPath="/contact">
  <article class="contact">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p>站点负责人：liuyongkai</p>
    <p>邮箱：<a href="mailto:liuyongkai@hotmail.com">liuyongkai@hotmail.com</a></p>
    <p>可以通过邮箱联系内容纠错、版权说明、广告合作、隐私请求和技术问题。</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .contact {
    max-width: 760px;
    padding: 54px 0;
  }

  h1 {
    color: var(--teal);
    font-size: 44px;
  }

  a {
    color: var(--cinnabar);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
